        "content_text": "<a href=\"https://www.nationalgeographic.com/animals/article/falcons-migration-angola-falcopolis\">\"For years, the secret winter home of rare red-footed falcons remained a mystery. Then an ornithologist discovered the hidden world of \"Falcopolis.\"\"</a>",
