        "content_text": "This year, a slew of musical fathers are hitting the road with new bandmates: their kids. [<a href=\"https://www.vulture.com/article/father-son-rock-bands-tour.html\">Vulture</a> / <a href=\"https://archive.ph/2Fd2v\">Archive</a>]",
