        "title": "The Children a Scientist Took Home",
        "url": "https://longreads.com/2026/08/24/carleton-gajdusek-abuse/",
        "content_text": "Carleton Gajdusek won the Nobel Prize for his work on a disease in Papua New Guinea. But his biggest experiment was on the children he took from the field to the US—many of whom he sexually molested, with the knowledge and, in some cases, approval of his professional peers and colleagues: In his journals and [&#8230;]",
