        "title": "Ford explains why it chose Apple Maps over Google for its new EVs",
        "url": "https://9to5mac.com/2026/09/01/ford-explains-why-it-chose-apple-maps-over-google-for-its-new-evs/",
        "content_text": "<div class=\"feat-image\"><img src=\"https://9to5mac.com/wp-content/uploads/sites/6/2026/04/apple-maps-generic-3d.jpg?quality=82&#038;strip=all&#038;w=1600\" /></div><p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Earlier this year, Apple <a href=\"https://9to5mac.com/2026/07/23/apple-maps-is-becoming-fords-new-navigation-mode-for-select-vehicles/\">announced</a> a partnership with Ford to bring native Apple Maps integration to the automaker’s upcoming Universal Electric Vehicle (UEV) Platform, including what we now know is <a href=\"https://electrek.co/2026/08/06/fords-affordable-ev-pickup-named-fathom-priced-from-28350/\">called the Fathom</a>.</p>\n\n\n\n <a data-layer-pagetype=\"post\" data-layer-postcategory=\"apple-maps,carplay\" data-layer-viewtype=\"unknown\" data-post-id=\"1067039\" href=\"https://9to5mac.com/2026/09/01/ford-explains-why-it-chose-apple-maps-over-google-for-its-new-evs/#more-1067039\" class=\"more-link\">more…</a>",
        "type": "Technology",
