        "content_text": "<div class=\"feat-image\"><img src=\"https://9to5mac.com/wp-content/uploads/sites/6/2026/09/steve-jobs.webp?w=1600\" /></div><p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Apple has <a href=\"https://9to5mac.com/2026/09/01/read-new-apple-ceo-john-ternuss-full-memo-to-employees/\">a new CEO</a> today. Meanwhile, a vintage video of Steve Jobs from 1996 has resurfaced. It adds some incredible perspective.</p>\n\n\n\n <a data-layer-pagetype=\"post\" data-layer-postcategory=\"\" data-layer-viewtype=\"unknown\" data-post-id=\"1066975\" href=\"https://9to5mac.com/2026/09/01/steve-jobs-in-1996-i-still-think-apple-has-a-future/#more-1066975\" class=\"more-link\">more…</a>",
