        "url": "https://9to5mac.com/2026/08/31/save-1600-roborock-products-including-flagship-saros-20/",
        "content_text": "<div class=\"feat-image\"><img src=\"https://9to5mac.com/wp-content/uploads/sites/6/2026/08/Save-up-to-630-on-Roborock-products-including-the-flagship-Saros-20.jpg?quality=82&#038;strip=all&#038;w=1400\" /></div><p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">It’s Roborock’s 12th anniversary, and the high-tech cleaning company is celebrating by <a href=\"https://bit.ly/4y2aq5C\" data-type=\"link\" data-id=\"https://bit.ly/4y2aq5C\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener sponsored nofollow\">offering generous discounts</a> across its range of robot cleaners and other products between now and September 6.</p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Discounts range from 25% to over 50% across the products and bundles included in the anniversary sale, with savings as high as $1600 …</p>\n\n\n\n <a data-layer-pagetype=\"post\" data-layer-postcategory=\"\" data-layer-viewtype=\"unknown\" data-post-id=\"1065996\" href=\"https://9to5mac.com/2026/08/31/save-1600-roborock-products-including-flagship-saros-20/#more-1065996\" class=\"more-link\">more…</a>",
