        "title": "iPhone 18 Pro: Three reasons you might want to upgrade from iPhone 17 Pro",
        "url": "https://9to5mac.com/2026/08/31/iphone-18-pro-three-reasons-you-might-want-to-upgrade-from-iphone-17-pro/",
        "content_text": "<div class=\"feat-image\"><img src=\"https://9to5mac.com/wp-content/uploads/sites/6/2026/04/iphone-17-pro-silver-camera-plateau.jpg?quality=82&#038;strip=all&#038;w=1600\" /></div><p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">iPhone 18 Pro will be unveiled <a href=\"https://9to5mac.com/2026/08/27/how-to-watch-apples-september-event-iphone-18-pro-iphone-ultra-more/\" data-type=\"post\" data-id=\"1066399\">next week</a>, and while most iPhone 17 Pro owners won’t upgrade so soon, for those considering a new iPhone there are three main features likely to motivate them.</p>\n\n\n\n <a data-layer-pagetype=\"post\" data-layer-postcategory=\"\" data-layer-viewtype=\"unknown\" data-post-id=\"1061945\" href=\"https://9to5mac.com/2026/08/31/iphone-18-pro-three-reasons-you-might-want-to-upgrade-from-iphone-17-pro/#more-1061945\" class=\"more-link\">more…</a>",
        "type": "Technology",
