        "url": "https://9to5mac.com/2026/08/28/steve-jobs-1968-science-fair-project-fetches-34375-at-auction/",
        "content_text": "<div class=\"feat-image\"><img src=\"https://9to5mac.com/wp-content/uploads/sites/6/2026/08/Steve-Jobs-8th-grade-science-fair-project-goes-up-for-auction.jpg?quality=82&#038;strip=all&#038;w=1600\" /></div><p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">RR Auction’s bidding for Steve Jobs’ 1968 science fair project has now closed, with the hand-built exhibit selling for $34,375. Here are the details.</p>\n\n\n\n <a data-layer-pagetype=\"post\" data-layer-postcategory=\"aapl,steve-jobs\" data-layer-viewtype=\"unknown\" data-post-id=\"1066607\" href=\"https://9to5mac.com/2026/08/28/steve-jobs-1968-science-fair-project-fetches-34375-at-auction/#more-1066607\" class=\"more-link\">more…</a>",
        "type": "Technology",
