        "content_text": "<div class=\"feat-image\"><img src=\"https://9to5mac.com/wp-content/uploads/sites/6/2026/09/adobe-slack.webp?w=1600\" /></div><p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Adobe is bringing its creative and productivity tools directly into Slack, letting teams create and edit images, videos, designs and PDFs without leaving the conversations where projects already take shape.</p>\n\n\n\n <a data-layer-pagetype=\"post\" data-layer-postcategory=\"adobe,apps,slack\" data-layer-viewtype=\"unknown\" data-post-id=\"1067061\" href=\"https://9to5mac.com/2026/09/02/adobe-brings-photoshop-firefly-and-70-creative-tools-to-slack-with-mcp-app/#more-1067061\" class=\"more-link\">more…</a>",
