        "url": "https://9to5mac.com/2026/09/01/here-are-iphone-18-pros-new-colors-says-leaker/",
        "content_text": "<div class=\"feat-image\"><img src=\"https://9to5mac.com/wp-content/uploads/sites/6/2026/02/iphone-18-pro-mockup.jpg?quality=82&#038;strip=all&#038;w=1600\" /></div><p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">iPhone 18 Pro will be <a href=\"https://9to5mac.com/2026/08/27/how-to-watch-apples-september-event-iphone-18-pro-iphone-ultra-more/\" data-type=\"post\" data-id=\"1066399\">unveiled next week</a>, and a new post from a reputable Weibo leaker names three new colors expected to debut.</p>\n\n\n\n <a data-layer-pagetype=\"post\" data-layer-postcategory=\"iphone,iphone-18-pro,iphone-18-pro-max\" data-layer-viewtype=\"unknown\" data-post-id=\"1066918\" href=\"https://9to5mac.com/2026/09/01/here-are-iphone-18-pros-new-colors-says-leaker/#more-1066918\" class=\"more-link\">more…</a>",
        "type": "Technology",
