        "url": "https://9to5mac.com/2026/08/28/deals-amazon-labor-day-sale-airpods-pro-3-m6-mac-mini/",
        "content_text": "<div class=\"feat-image\"><img src=\"https://9to5mac.com/wp-content/uploads/sites/6/2026/08/Apple-deals-M6-Mac-mini-AirPods-AirTag-2.jpg?quality=82&#038;strip=all&#038;w=1600\" /></div><p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">The massive 2026 Amazon Labor Day sale is now live with $50 off AirPods Pro 3 and the ongoing all-time low on AirTag 2 from just $20 each. However, today’s <em>9to5Toys Lunch Break</em> is headlined by Amazon now offering the first cash discounts on the brand new M6 Mac mini and M5 Pro Mac mini as well as this wild deal on the Apple iPhone Air MagSafe Battery from $39 and the best price ever on the 44mm Apple Watch SE 3 at <strong>$200</strong>. We also have the <a href=\"https://9to5toys.com/2026/08/28/amazon-anker-labor-day-sale-now-live-at-up-to-42-off/\">Anker Labor Day sale</a> now live at <a href=\"https://9to5toys.com/2026/08/28/amazon-anker-labor-day-sale-now-live-at-up-to-42-off/\">up to 42% off</a>, the <a href=\"https://9to5toys.com/2026/08/28/bose-2026-labor-deals-now-live/\">Bose 2026 Labor Day deals</a> now live at <a href=\"https://9to5toys.com/2026/08/28/bose-2026-labor-deals-now-live/\">up to $320 off</a>, and make sure you score yourself the new Apple Polishing Cloth for $9 Prime shipped before it sells out. Everything awaits below. </p>\n\n\n\n <a data-layer-pagetype=\"post\" data-layer-postcategory=\"9to5toys,9to5toys-lunch-break,deals\" data-layer-viewtype=\"unknown\" data-post-id=\"1066553\" href=\"https://9to5mac.com/2026/08/28/deals-amazon-labor-day-sale-airpods-pro-3-m6-mac-mini/#more-1066553\" class=\"more-link\">more…</a>",
        "type": "Technology",
