        "url": "https://www.oreilly.com/radar/zero-to-agent-in-30-minutes-building-a-financial-news-agent-with-jayeeta-putatunda/",
        "content_text": "In this episode of Zero to Agent in 30 Minutes, Jayeeta Putatunda, forward deployed AI engineering lead at Turing, builds a multi-agent workflow that turns a daily flood of financial headlines into a structured analyst briefing. Financial analysts already have deep internal research, coverage assignments, and market views, but keeping that context current as new [&#8230;]",
