        "url": "https://www.oreilly.com/radar/architectural-guardrails-for-ai-generated-code/",
        "content_text": "Consider a composite of a failure pattern that’s becoming increasingly common on teams that have scaled AI-assisted development past a handful of enthusiasts. A staff engineer named Priya opens a pull request. The PR is 340 lines and adds an endpoint that writes to the customer table directly, bypassing the internal customer service API. The [&#8230;]",
