        "title": "This Week in AI: The Guardrails Are Getting Tested",
        "url": "https://www.oreilly.com/radar/this-week-in-ai-the-guardrails-are-getting-tested/",
        "content_text": "In the latest episode of This Week in AI, host Vicki Reyzelman, a solutions engineer with Akamai, said the systems keeping AI secure, powered, and physically functional are getting stress-tested faster than anyone expected. She moved through cybersecurity and governance, the power strain behind rising compute demand, and humanoid robots that are now doing real [&#8230;]",
