        "url": "https://www.oreilly.com/radar/tokens-arent-dollars/",
        "content_text": "The following article originally appeared on Tim O’Brien’s Medium blog and is being republished here with the author’s permission. AI costs are easy to count and hard to understand, and judging effort by a token volume? While that might feel like a valid measure of value or complexity, it doesn’t capture the details that define [&#8230;]",
