        "url": "https://www.oreilly.com/radar/writing-with-ai/",
        "content_text": "A lot of professional writers say they never do it. And for writers who do, the consequences can be serious. Book contracts have been withdrawn. People have lost jobs. I have a contrarian view. I say AI is a medium, like painting, sculpture, photography, music, or language itself. If AI is a medium, it is [&#8230;]",
