        "url": "https://www.oreilly.com/radar/shadow-agents-standing-privileges-and-the-governance-gap-between-deployment-and-discovery/",
        "content_text": "There was a brief window where AI agent security felt like a future problem. Organizations deployed copilots, coding assistants, and autonomous workflows on the assumption that the worst case was a bad recommendation or a hallucinated answer. That window closed in the first half of 2026, when a cluster of vulnerabilities and a landmark incident [&#8230;]",
